cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "sig.gabrielpantoja.cl — Land GIS"
abstract: >-
  Interactive open-data web GIS of rural land transactions recorded by Chilean
  Real Estate Registries (Conservadores de Bienes Raíces) across south-central
  Chile, combined with official thematic layers (protected areas, urban and
  communal boundaries, road and drainage networks, transmission lines,
  agricultural soils, vegetation, wetlands, bioclimate, NDVI) and a value heat map of
  median price per square metre. Built for ecoinformatics research and as a
  reference tool for rural appraisal.
authors:
  - given-names: Gabriel
    family-names: Pantoja
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
license: MIT
